  "accepted_answers": [
    "Member of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey",
    "municipal council member"
  ],
  "explanation": "Both answers are supported by direct textual evidence from the provided sources. D1S3 explicitly states that Zeki Hakan Sidali holds the position of Member of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey, with additional corroboration from D1S8 and D1S15. D2S7 confirms that he is a municipal council member (\"took his seat alongside the other conseillers municipaux\"). These are distinct positions held by the same individual in two different jurisdictions (Turkey and France), and there is no contradiction or conflict in the referent. The candidate 'conseiller municipal' (C2) is functionally equivalent to 'municipal council member' (C1) and is not independently necessary."
}

